# The image build copies exactly one file out of the context: the Valkey
# CLUSTER MYSLOTS patch. Everything else is transfer cost, and artifacts/ alone
# passes 700 MB after a handful of real runs, which stalls the build on macOS
# before a single step executes.
*
!patches
!patches/valkey
!patches/valkey/0001-add-cluster-myslots.patch
